<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>RAZR SLIDE R12 双侧互锁工程交互检查</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#101b29;--card:#1a2b40;--line:#405b74;--txt:#edf5ff;--hint:#a5bbd2;--blue:#57b3e7;--orange:#fec17b;--red:#f77;--green:#7fdfae}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;margin:0;padding:22px;line-height:1.55}.container{max-width:1150px;margin:auto}.hint{color:var(--hint)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px minmax(450px,1fr);gap:18px}@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}section{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}.controls label{display:block;margin-top:14px;font-weight:600}.controls input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--blue)}select,button{background:#2a4765;color:#fff;border:1px solid #54708a;border-radius:7px;padding:10px;font-size:14px}button{cursor:pointer;margin:5px 4px 0 0}button:hover{background:#315b7b}svg{display:block;width:100%;max-height:650px;border:1px solid #35506b;background:#132236;border-radius:10px}.status{padding:12px;margin-top:15px;border-radius:8px;background:#263d54}.bad{border-left:4px solid var(--red)}.good{border-left:4px solid var(--green)}.statrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #334d65}small{color:var(--hint)}.legend{font-size:13px;color:var(--hint)}.smallcaps{letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#78bfe9;font-size:12px}h1{margin:4px 0 10px;font-size:25px}h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 12px}p{margin:8px 0 16px}
</style></head><body><div class="container"><div class="smallcaps">RAZR SLIDE · Mechanical Verification · R12</div><h1>双侧独立锁狗、凸轮与止挡公差交互检查</h1><p class="hint">本页仅显示已建模的R12局部几何与公式，不是实物有限元，也不是安全放行。终点前的红色状态是主动保留的机械失效反例。</p>
<div class="grid"><section class="controls"><h2>位置与公差</h2><label for="s">B舱纵向行程 <span id="snum"></span> mm</label><input id="s" type="range" min="0" max="79.75" step="0.01" value="79.75"/><label>左侧鼻端＋止挡合成误差</label><select id="left"><option value="-.2">−0.20 mm（较晚）</option><option value="0" selected>0 mm（名义）</option><option value=".2">+0.20 mm（较早）</option></select><label>右侧合成误差</label><select id="right"><option value="-.2">−0.20 mm（较晚）</option><option value="0" selected>0 mm（名义）</option><option value=".2">+0.20 mm（较早）</option></select><label><input id="stuck" type="checkbox"/> 左侧卡死，狗齿保持锁闭</label><div style="padding-top:10px"><button onclick="preset('normal')">正常终点</button><button onclick="preset('early')">提前退锁反例</button><button onclick="preset('failed')">单侧失效</button><button onclick="preset('return')">反向复位</button></div><div id="stats" class="status"></div></section>
<section><h2>同一参数源 · 侧边机构平面投影</h2><svg viewBox="0 0 650 650" aria-label="左右侧接收器、阻挡狗齿、凸轮和B捕获销的俯视图"><g id="drawing"></g></svg><div class="legend">灰蓝：接收器 | 橙色透明：Y向凸轮板 | 红色：X向锁狗 | 黄色：B舱捕获销 | 绿色：B舱致动鼻端。左右图使用相同坐标比例与相反镜像。</div></section></div>
<section style="margin-top:18px"><h2>必须保持的机械约束</h2><p>只要任一侧狗齿与其B舱捕获销仍有实体重叠，Z向就位就应被机械阻挡。两侧都退出只是必要条件，不等于整体安全。实际的J槽、终点载荷、弹簧预紧、制造公差、OLED和FPC仍应独立校验。</p><p style="color:#ff9b9b">R12在 s=79.35 mm、左右均+0.20mm误差时，两个狗齿可提前退出，同时J槽已几何开放。这是已用STEP实体相交计算重现的拒绝放行理由。</p></section>
</div><script>
const S=79.75, doglo=35.74,doghi=36.13,ratio=1.05, pinlo=35.78,pinhi=36.22;const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const lim=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x));
function calc(s,error,stuck){const u=stuck?0:lim(.85+s-S+error,0,.85),dx=ratio*u,lo=doglo-dx,hi=doghi-dx,overlap=Math.max(0,Math.min(hi,pinhi)-Math.max(lo,pinlo));return {u,lo,hi,overlap}};
const NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';function svgEl(name,attrs,parent){let el=document.createElementNS(NS,name);for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(attrs))el.setAttribute(k,v);parent.append(el);return el}
function renderGroup(parent,xOffset,left,s,a){const g=svgEl('g',{transform:`translate(${xOffset},0)`},parent),sx=120,sy=69,y0=86;const X=x=>32+(x-33.6)*sx,Y=y=>585-(y-y0)*sy;function rr(x0,x1,y0,y1,fill,op,stroke){svgEl('rect',{x:X(x0),y:Y(y1),width:(x1-x0)*sx,height:(y1-y0)*sy,fill,opacity:op,stroke:stroke||fill,'stroke-width':'1.1'},g)}
svgEl('text',{x:165,y:24,fill:'#dceefc','font-size':'18','text-anchor':'middle'},g).textContent=left?'左侧':'右侧';rr(35.25,36.7,86.63,93.55,'#5680aa',.19);rr(35.25,36.7,87.4-.625,87.4+.625,'#081929',.78,'#5dbbff');rr(34.85,36.6,87.75+a.u,91.24+a.u,'#ffae58',.25);rr(a.lo,a.hi,86.95,87.85,'#fb6978',.92);rr(pinlo,pinhi,s+7.65-.2,s+7.65+.2,'#ffd481',.95);rr(35.66,35.98,s+12.1-.18,s+12.1,'#7bdfaf',.85);svgEl('circle',{cx:X(36.1-1.05*a.u),cy:Y(89.0),r:5,fill:'#fb6978'},g);svgEl('line',{x1:X(33.66),x2:X(33.66),y1:35,y2:610,stroke:'#7bdfaf','stroke-width':2,'stroke-dasharray':'5,5'},g);svgEl('line',{x1:X(36.995),x2:X(36.995),y1:35,y2:610,stroke:'#fff','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'2,4'},g);
svgEl('text',{x:165,y:631,fill:a.overlap>.0001?'#ff9898':'#7bdfaf','font-size':'15','text-anchor':'middle'},g).textContent=`挡销重叠 ${a.overlap.toFixed(3)} mm`;
}
function update(){const s=+$('s').value,left=calc(s,+$('left').value,$('stuck').checked),right=calc(s,+$('right').value,false);$('snum').textContent=s.toFixed(2);const windowOpen=s>=S-(.625-.2)-1e-9;const twoOpen=left.overlap<1e-8 && right.overlap<1e-8;let el=$('drawing');el.replaceChildren();renderGroup(el,0,true,s,left);renderGroup(el,320,false,s,right);
let safety=twoOpen&&windowOpen&&s<S-.001;let stat=$('stats');stat.className='status '+(safety?'bad':'good');stat.innerHTML=`<div class="statrow"><b>距纵向终点</b><span>${(S-s).toFixed(3)} mm</span></div><div class="statrow"><span>左/右推杆行程</span><span>${left.u.toFixed(3)} / ${right.u.toFixed(3)} mm</span></div><div class="statrow"><span>单侧仍机械挡Z？</span><span>${(left.overlap>1e-8?'左 ':'')+(right.overlap>1e-8?'右':'') || '两侧均已退出'}</span></div><div class="statrow"><span>J槽允许穿过？</span><span>${windowOpen?'是（简化Y包络）':'否'}</span></div><b style="color:${safety?'#ff9b9b':'#7bdfaf'}">${safety?'危险：尚未达硬止挡，局部Z通路已开放':'局部几何：未出现双侧提前Z逃逸'}</b>`;}
function preset(mode){$('s').value=mode==='early'?79.35:mode==='return'?78.5:79.75;$('left').value=mode==='early'?'.2':'0';$('right').value=mode==='early'?'.2':'0';$('stuck').checked=mode==='failed';update()}
for(const id of ['s','left','right','stuck'])$(id).addEventListener('input',update);update();
</script></body></html>
